WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:03.400
A lot of us have fond memories of Halloween.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.580
Dressing up in spooky costumes, wandering
around the neighborhood with friends while

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:12.330
trick or treating, getting home with literal
buckets full of candy, and then eating so

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:15.200
many sugary treats that you feel sick.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:21.249
Halloween is a beloved holiday, especially
throughout many parts of the United States.

00:00:21.249 --> 00:00:25.289
And if you were lucky enough to grow up in
a town that really went all out when the last

00:00:25.289 --> 00:00:30.599
night of October rolled around, then you may
even have had a local Halloween themed fairground

00:00:30.599 --> 00:00:33.480
to visit on the creepiest night of the year.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:38.090
Scary rides, mazes, and jack o’ lanterns
as far as the eye can see.

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:43.480
But, with all that said, if you lived in a
certain town in the Midwest, then maybe the

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:48.610
county fair is a little more frightening than
the spirit of the Halloween season usually

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:49.960
encourages.

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:59.410
Settle in for a story of scares, a tale of
terror and a fable of frights, this is SCP-097,

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:02.780
also known as Old Fairgrounds.

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:08.130
Cordoned off by the SCP Foundation using huge
concrete walls is ten acres of rural land

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:12.270
in an undisclosed area of the Midwestern United
States.

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:17.640
The place itself is completely abandoned,
left silent and alone as everything contained

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:21.620
within those walls slowly falls into disrepair.

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:27.570
This is all that remains of the local County
Fair, held in the year 1969.

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:29.030
And right in the middle of it all?

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:32.520
A pickup truck, crushed and wrecked beyond
all use.

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:39.030
But this truck didn’t crash, oh no this
was no tragic roadside accident.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:42.319
The thing that crushed it happened to be a
gigantic pumpkin.

00:01:42.319 --> 00:01:47.039
Now, we aren’t just talking about a local
vegetable growing competition winner here.

00:01:47.039 --> 00:01:51.979
When we say this is a big pumpkin, we are
talking huge.

00:01:51.979 --> 00:01:57.290
The colossal squash has been recorded to measure
well over seven meters in height, with a diameter

00:01:57.290 --> 00:02:00.469
just over eight meters at the widest point.

00:02:00.469 --> 00:02:08.610
According to estimates, this pumpkin, known
as SCP-097-1, weighs an enormous 15,000 kilograms,

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:11.410
or 33,070 pounds.

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:15.370
To give you a frame of reference, that’s
about four times the average weight of a hippopotamus.

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:21.420
The pumpkin even manages to keep a perfectly
spherical shape, staying plump and round rather

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:26.420
than spreading out under its own weight, as
you might expect a plant of such size would.

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:29.849
Okay, a pickup truck crushed by a giant pumpkin?

00:02:29.849 --> 00:02:32.760
You might be wondering, surely that can’t
be all there is?

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:37.720
Well, don’t you worry, we’re just getting
started with this creep show.

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:43.840
The rest of the surrounding area of SCP-097
is abundant in overgrown pumpkins, none that

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:50.970
quite reach the enviable size of SCP-097-1,
but plenty of all different subspecies and

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:51.970
types.

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:57.739
On average, these smaller pumpkins weigh around
250 kilograms, or 550 pounds.

00:02:57.739 --> 00:03:03.310
Along with various other crops that have grown
within the area of SCP-097, the pumpkins seem

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:07.130
to have formed some kind of maze, no pun intended.

00:03:07.130 --> 00:03:12.379
Get it, maize like corn?

00:03:12.379 --> 00:03:14.329
These jokes are wasted on you.

00:03:14.329 --> 00:03:18.980
Spooky mazes are no strange inclusion at rural
Halloween fairs like this one.

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:23.180
Getting lost in the middle of the night, surrounded
by rows of corn taller than a human being

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:25.040
is all part of the fun.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:28.680
Makes a person feel like they’re right in
the middle of a classic eighties slasher movie,

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:32.640
where the killer could be creeping up behind
them any second.

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:37.280
The naturally formed labyrinth found within
SCP-097 has spread all throughout what is

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:42.760
left of the 1969 county fairgrounds, with
the “walls” of crops reaching over one

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:46.380
and a half meters tall, depending on the year.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:48.300
So, is that all?

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:51.209
A maze of crops with one giant pumpkin at
its center?

00:03:51.209 --> 00:03:55.719
Oh, that’s far from all there is to SCP-097.

00:03:55.719 --> 00:04:00.150
During the time between April and November
of every year, a number of bizarre and anomalous

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:05.650
phenomena take place within this abandoned
county fairground, ranging from strange happenings

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:09.940
that defy explanation, to things that are
downright dangerous.

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:15.939
Since they first came into contact with SCP-097,
the Foundation have lost eight agents to the

00:04:15.939 --> 00:04:21.459
phenomena that occur within that area, with
a another seventeen being severely maimed.

00:04:21.459 --> 00:04:26.520
While the exact time of these events seems
to vary, the SCP Foundation keeps an extensive

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:29.540
record of phenomena that occur within SCP-097.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:35.130
Now sometimes, these will be as harmless and
annoying as the sound of drums playing throughout

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:38.560
the day, for almost twenty four hours without
stopping.

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:42.789
Then, there’s the sightings of entities
moving through the maze only to disappear

00:04:42.789 --> 00:04:45.289
after a few short seconds.

00:04:45.289 --> 00:04:49.449
Security footage the Foundation’s agents
have gathered of these entities depict them

00:04:49.449 --> 00:04:55.110
as what can only be described as “bed sheet
ghosts”, the kind you might see and immediately

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:59.120
think of as a last minute low budget Halloween
costume.

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:05.789
On one particular occasion, singing was heard
in the maze, coming from an unidentified source.

00:05:05.789 --> 00:05:10.720
When analyzed, recordings made by the Foundation
revealed there were up to thirty children’s

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:16.210
voices, all singing in unintelligible gibberish
for three consecutive hours.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:21.120
Another incident involved a member of personnel
on site, Agent McRoy, who cut a pumpkin vine

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:22.710
using a machete.

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.990
Horrifyingly, the severed vine bled.

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:30.630
By that we mean, actual human blood came pouring
out of the plant.

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:37.220
Another agent, on a separate occasion, was
also found dead within the SCP-097 maze.

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:41.900
Agent Long had disappeared on the way to the
restroom, only to be discovered lifeless and

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:44.759
bloodied, resting against a pumpkin.

00:05:44.759 --> 00:05:50.830
During one weekly examination of SCP-097,
one Agent Cole broke open a pumpkin completely

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:52.150
by accident.

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:56.790
As the pumpkin split apart, however, to the
agent’s horror, a child’s skeleton was

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.270
revealed to be inside.

00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:04.830
A human child’s skeleton, a little girl
crouched in the fetal position, believed to

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.910
only have been about five years of age.

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:13.510
Another incident saw O’Toole, a research
assistant working on site at SCP-097 experiencing

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:15.180
symptoms of nausea.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:21.199
O’Toole also appeared to be vomiting pumpkin
seeds, despite not having eaten any recently.

00:06:21.199 --> 00:06:25.849
Within a day, O’Toole was dead, seeming
to have died overnight in his sleep.

00:06:25.849 --> 00:06:29.710
An autopsy conducted by Foundation experts
revealed that O’Toole’s chest cavity,

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:35.400
the space beneath his ribs, was somehow filled
with the same pumpkin seeds.

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:39.460
All of these happenings are strange to say
the least, but perhaps most concerning of

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:46.090
all is the effect that the abandoned fairground
of SCP-097 seems to have on children.

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:51.229
Any under or up to the age of ten years old
can fall victim to an unpredictable signal

00:06:51.229 --> 00:06:59.159
that seems to emanate from SCP-097, with a
maximum range that is, as of yet, undetermined.

00:06:59.159 --> 00:07:03.289
Usually beginning in early April, children
that are affected by this signal become afflicted

00:07:03.289 --> 00:07:08.120
with somnambulism, or sleep walking as it
is more commonly known.

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:13.000
On clear nights, these children will wander
around their own homes, often only stopping

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.419
in front of closed doorways.

00:07:15.419 --> 00:07:21.000
This behavior usually doesn’t happen often,
at least at first, only occurring once a week.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:25.580
However, sleep walking gradually becomes more
frequent, and by around the middle of August,

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:28.330
it will be a nightly occurrence.

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:32.289
If children with this affliction are ever
woken up while sleepwalking, they will scream

00:07:32.289 --> 00:07:35.460
for several seconds, before appearing confused.

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:39.500
This seems to be the only known way to break
the influence of SCP-097.

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:45.460
However, if left undisturbed, a child will
spend their sleep walking episodes familiarizing

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:48.289
themselves with the doorways of their house.

00:07:48.289 --> 00:07:53.430
They will stop at every entrance, exit, garage
door, gate, even the neighbors’ front doors

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:55.610
once they find a way outside.

00:07:55.610 --> 00:08:00.419
From September, the sleepwalking children
will stay outside, upright but asleep until

00:08:00.419 --> 00:08:02.070
the sun comes up.

00:08:02.070 --> 00:08:06.000
Many are often found laying on the grass in
their gardens, and commonly recall having

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:09.159
dreams about autumn-season activities.

00:08:09.159 --> 00:08:13.840
Between September first and November first,
any affected child not awoken during their

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:19.030
sleepwalking will begin to migrate towards
SCP-097’s location.

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:23.770
All while still unconscious, they will traverse
country roads, cutting across large empty

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:29.720
fields, as they gradually make their way towards
the abandoned remains of the county fairground.

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:34.110
Once there, they will even be able to blindly
navigate a path through the maze that surrounds

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:38.990
most of SCP-097, until they find the center.

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:41.779
What happens when they make it to the center
of the maze?

00:08:41.779 --> 00:08:47.820
Any sleepwalking children who are able to
make it that far will seek out SCP-097-1,

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:52.710
the gigantic pumpkin crushing the truck in
the middle of the SCP-097 area.

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:58.050
The children will then sit down around the
almost 23 foot tall pumpkin, and begin to

00:08:58.050 --> 00:08:59.050
sing.

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:03.200
Even though the SCP Foundation have managed
to make recordings of this, much of the singing

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:07.820
seems to be gibberish, or at least not sung
in any known language.

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:12.920
However, music will also begin playing from
an unknown source, seeming to include a number

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:17.570
of basic instruments, most commonly simple
drums and pipes.

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:21.380
After the sleepwalking children have spent
a number of minutes singing like this, that

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:26.860
is when things take a turn for the far, far
worse, like a Charlie Brown Halloween special

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:30.130
straight out of your most horrific nightmares.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:35.899
From the tangled mess of plants that make
up the maze within SCP-097, things will start

00:09:35.899 --> 00:09:37.470
to emerge.

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:41.800
These entities will crawl out of the surrounding
flora, or will come bursting out from within

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:44.410
the larger of the nearby pumpkins.

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:49.090
They appear to be childlike in both their
appearance and mannerisms, some even wearing

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:51.640
pajamas or similar clothing.

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:52.640
Why?

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:56.240
Simple, because these are the children that
sleep walked before.

00:09:56.240 --> 00:10:01.610
They are all previous victims, the ones stolen
from their families and brought into this

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:02.610
maze.

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:06.389
Still wearing the clothes that they were last
seen in; they are all the children known to

00:10:06.389 --> 00:10:09.639
be lost to SCP-097.

00:10:09.639 --> 00:10:12.230
What happens next is truly chilling.

00:10:12.230 --> 00:10:16.130
The latest child that has been affected by
the draw of the pumpkin-filled fairground

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:19.690
will be quickly surrounded by all their fellow
victims.

00:10:19.690 --> 00:10:25.750
The other children, if they are in fact still
human children, will encircle the newest child,

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:28.800
singing and dancing around them in a circle.

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:35.850
As they do this, a dim light begins to glow
from somewhere within SCP-097-1, the biggest

00:10:35.850 --> 00:10:38.779
pumpkin in the center of SCP-097.

00:10:38.779 --> 00:10:44.269
Finally, at this point in the process, the
newly affected child will wake up.

00:10:44.269 --> 00:10:48.370
Normally, they experience a great deal of
terror and confusion.

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:52.769
After all, they have been unconscious throughout
this entire ordeal, sleepwalking far away

00:10:52.769 --> 00:10:57.329
from the safety of their own home to a maze
in the middle of nowhere.

00:10:57.329 --> 00:11:02.630
Terror is a powerful thing, enough to make
even the bravest person let out a scream.

00:11:02.630 --> 00:11:08.180
But the moment the now awakened child lets
out any sound, that is when they are doomed.

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:13.580
Should they scream, cry or make any form of
vocal noise, then the others will swarm them.

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:19.130
The other children, the ones previously lured
into SCP-097 while sleep walking, will attack

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:20.839
the terrified newcomer.

00:11:20.839 --> 00:11:26.050
Each time is different, sometimes they will
claw at the new child, other times they might

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:27.350
bite or kick.

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:31.500
The methods are always different, but most
often this swarm of the pumpkin’s previous

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:36.589
victims will strangle or dismember the latest
visitor to the abandoned fairground.

00:11:36.589 --> 00:11:40.459
At this point, there is no saving the latest
victim.

00:11:40.459 --> 00:11:45.660
Any attempt to interfere will only fail, either
the children will all become intangible, or

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:51.630
another violent phenomenon will occur within
SCP-097, stopping any onlooker from saving

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:52.940
the child’s life.

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:57.959
When the deed is finally done, and the latest
victim has been killed by the other children,

00:11:57.959 --> 00:12:01.970
the gigantic pumpkin at the heart of SCP-097
will open.

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:06.699
Its side will split like a pair of great,
devouring jaws, and the children will throw

00:12:06.699 --> 00:12:11.410
the body of the newest child into SCP-097-1.

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:15.970
Once the body has been disposed of, these
entities, once children that sleep walked

00:12:15.970 --> 00:12:20.930
away from their families, will follow, crawling
into the pumpkin before it closes and the

00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:23.120
music finally stops.

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:27.190
The exact number of children between the ages
of three and ten years of age who have been

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:31.829
lost to SCP-097 is currently kept secret by
the Foundation.

00:12:31.829 --> 00:12:36.550
And perhaps, for all of our sanities, that
is for the best.

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:40.360
Like we said, a lot of us have fond memories
of Halloween.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:42.420
But not all of us...

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:48.110
Now go check out “SCP-823 - Carnival of
Horrors” and “SCP Herman Fuller's Circus

00:12:48.110 --> 00:12:52.250
of the Disquieting” for more creepy carnivals
and unsettling circuses!

